<title>SPAIN: Spain's Abengoa share price fixed at 4,250 ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Abengoa share price fixed at 4,250 ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's applied engineering and equipment firm Abengoa fixed the price for its initial public offering at 4,250 pesetas, the stock market commission CNMV said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shares in Abengoa, representing a stake of 33 percent of its capital, will be floated on the Spanish stock exchange from tomorrow.</p>
<p>Grupo de Inversion Corporativa, which has a 53.32 percent stake in Abengoa, will retain control of the firm.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
